Error [E0351]: The value tree is named `Dyn`, not `Data`
  --> tests/ui/data_renamed_to_dyn.jet:2:14
    |
  2 |     value :: Data.Text("old")
    |              ^^^^
 Why: `Dyn` is the one name a hand codec constructs and returns and every format's `parse` yields — its variants are `.Null`/`.Bool`/`.Int`/`.Float`/`.Number`/`.Text`/`.Bytes`/`.DateTime`/`.Array`/`.Object`
 Fix: Write `Dyn` instead of `Data`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0351
